# Only manifests, signatures, timestamps and public keys are committed.
# Images live in the public bucket.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.tif
*.tiff
*.html
*.md
!README.md
# A post's signed Markdown IS published: it is the subject of SHA512SUMS-html,
# so a reader must be able to fetch those exact bytes to verify the signature.
# The blog repo is private, which makes this repo the only public home for it.
!*/index.md
*.ots.bak
*.bak-*
